  "description": "Protect your vehicle with the OEDRO Dodge Floor Mats. They feature a black design that adds a sleek and rugged touch to your vehicle. Universal in size and shape, they match well with Dodge vehicles.\nFeatures\nAll-weather guard. Floor mats TPE composition ensures 100% safe, 100% odorless, and environmentally friendly in all weather (rain, fog, snow, etc).\nNo sliding. Dodge floor mats use snap styles, snap-in clips can prevent the car liner set from moving or blocking the pedals.\nTough& Durable. OEDRO floor mats have 300% better temperature resistance than PVC. The high-density TPE material not only feels nice and is extremely wear-resistant, but also remains flexible in extremely cold weather.\nEasy to clean. Wipes down easily. OEDRO floor mats are used in the Y-shaped groove, which is capable of trap Liquid, Milk, Snow, Dirt, Sand, etc. And keep Your Car and Shoes Clean.\n2 years warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended\nFitment\nCompatible with 2012 2013 2014 2015 2016 2107 2018 Dodge Ram 1500.\nCompatible with 2019 2020 2021 2022 2023 2024 Dodge Ram 1500 Classic Models (NOT for New Body Models).\nCab Style: Quad Cab (Extended Cab).\nFor 2012 models, only fits pickup has 2 retention hooks on the driver and passenger-side floor.",
  "highlights": [
    "Premium Interior Protection: OEDRO Floor mats trap dirt, debris, and liquids to keep your vehicle floor clean and protected.",
    "Secure Driving Confidence: Anti-slip texture keeps mats firmly in place, helping ensure a safer and more stable ride.",
    "Built to Last: Durable, recyclable Thermoplastic Elastomer construction delivers long-term protection with easy maintenance."
  ],
